{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">94 歲的胡楓（修哥）日前因身體抱恙，被緊急送往伊利沙伯醫院深切治療部（ICU）救治，期間一度昏迷 4 天。修哥昨日在社交平台發布影片，在新抱 Jojo 陪同下交代病情，透露自己因急性膽管炎引發膽石阻塞，一度因呼吸困難需要插喉。醫生形容修哥今次是「天堂打咗個轉」，指出膽管炎有機會引發併發症，若細菌入血或導致敗血症，幸好及時就醫。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-31 上午10.25.59.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20263QJ83CbdJI1785464774.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-31 上午10.25.59.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">修哥在影片中憶述醒來時的情境：「我一睜開眼個環境好陌生，醫護人員問我叫咩名，我答中咗佢好開心，雖然係醒咗，但非常辛苦，因為我被五花大綁，唔畀我掩到塊臉，又唔可以掂到心口嘅喉管。」修哥又指，在睡夢中不斷想起家人及朋友，令他更珍惜與大家見面的機會。他感性表示：「我又諗起我啲契仔契女，好想見返佢哋，所以好積極我嘅人生。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"VS----0’01” (5).jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026dcboZaIFzX1785464774.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"VS----0’01” (5).jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"VS----0’17”.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026QgLCKu8KsM1785464775.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"VS----0’17”.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T02:39:50.489548+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}